#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:5 b25c3c428d3f40358c99bd254e381e0b
msgid "Limiting Maximum Battery Power Draw"
msgstr "限制最大电池功率消耗"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:7 cf73715fd7bb497d93ecbf68fac3a615
msgid ""
"Sometimes power needs to be limited to prevent issues with battery sag or "
"overheating. This can occur because of the use of lower C rated batteries, "
"high power motors, high ambient temperatures, uncooled engines or ESCs, or "
"other reasons. This topic discusses ways to limit the maximum power draw "
"from batteries."
msgstr ""
"有时需要限制功率，以防止电池电压跌落或过热等问题。其原因可能是使用了 C "
"数较低的电池、大功率电机、环境温度过高、发动机或电调缺乏散热等。本主题讨论限制电池最大功率消耗的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:10 6d524a366a554f23ac1ecbb269f8ede9
msgid "Methods to Limit Maximum Power Draw"
msgstr "限制最大功率消耗的方法"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:12 c3be4f688a7044989ef54721e9d5efc1
msgid ""
"The first and simplest is to restrict :ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>` to a "
"lower value. This limits the maximum throttle controlled allowed. "
"Unfortunately, this will not set an exact power limit and might require some"
" trial and error to find the right setting."
msgstr ""
"第一种也是最简单的方法是将 :ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>` "
"限制为较低的值。这会限制允许的最大油门。遗憾的是，这无法设定精确的功率限制，可能需要反复试验才能找到合适的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:14 412d2708440f4c56b80e4d7828b906e6
msgid ""
"A better way is to use a power limiting parameter (shown for first battery "
"monitor):"
msgstr "更好的方法是使用功率限制参数（以第一个电池监测为例）："

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:16 35cc898c54eb4d7788299dddbef2ae94
msgid ":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:18 49388641c91948d19d4b92d88f6cb854
msgid ""
"The :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` parameter can be used to limit the "
"total wattage that can be drawn from the battery(s). If battery power "
"exceeds this value then the system will reduce max throttle "
"(:ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>`) to lower the power draw. If power demand "
"is reduced, the max throttle will slowly grow back to "
":ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>`. Use 0 (default) to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` "
"参数可用于限制从电池汲取的总功率（瓦数）。如果电池功率超过该值，系统将降低最大油门（:ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>`）以降低功率消耗。若功率需求降低，最大油门将缓慢恢复到"
" :ref:`MOT_THR_MAX<MOT_THR_MAX>`。设置为 0（默认值）可禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:20 71e370ae2e5c4ccab0e336245b0bc01f
msgid ""
"The power limiting feature uses a low-pass filter to smooth out the power "
"readings and prevent rapid fluctuations in throttle. In some cases this can "
"lead to a delay in power limiter activating or deactivating. The "
":ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` parameter can be adjusted to change"
" the time constant of this filter and improve the responsiveness of the "
"power limiter. The default value is 2."
msgstr ""
"功率限制功能使用低通滤波器来平滑功率读数，防止油门快速波动。在某些情况下，这可能导致功率限制器的启用或退出出现延迟。可调整 "
":ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` 参数来改变该滤波器的时间常数，以改善功率限制器的响应性。默认值为 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:22 657aca37cb854d3fb8958c5c2ef72e4b
msgid ""
"The following table shows the effect of different :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC "
"<MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` values on the responsiveness of the power limiter. The "
"power ratio is the ratio of actual power draw to the "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` limit. The percentage values show how "
"much the max throttle is reduced per second at different power ratios for "
"different time constants."
msgstr ""
"下表显示了不同 :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` 值对功率限制器响应性的影响。功率比是实际功率消耗与 "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` 限制值之比。百分比数值表示在不同功率比和不同时间常数下，最大油门每秒降低的幅度。"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:25 5a28d8bf7118423cbb79e99e0c1a718a
msgid "Power Ratio"
msgstr "功率比"

#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:25 a204e42fa32f49f5971925b1ce8cdda0
