#: ../../source/docs/batt-watt-max.rst:34 6d83f6380aa3481fb59c1f98946fa970
msgid ""
"For example, if the power draw is 50% above the "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` limit (power ratio of 1.5) and "
":ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` is set to 2, then the max throttle "
"will be reduced by 24% per second. If the power draw is 10 times above the "
"limit (power ratio of 10) and :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` is "
"set to 5, then the max throttle will be reduced by 179% per second."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果功率消耗超出 :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` 限制值 50%（功率比为 1.5），且 "
":ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` 设置为 2，则最大油门将以每秒 24% "
"的速度降低。如果功率消耗达到限制值的 10 倍（功率比为 10），且 :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` "
"设置为 5，则最大油门将以每秒 179% 的速度降低。"
